window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Survive Demon Reform Academy, break the curse, seal my fate, and destroy Dark Veil before it destroys demonkind.</b></p> <p>The curse woven into my soul wasn't just draining my powers—it was killing me. And the only way to break it was to claim each one of my mates, ensuring all five matebonds connected to my soul were sealed. But that meant delving into the broken parts of their souls—and worse, facing the darkness dwelling within my own.</p> <p>Dark Veil's corruption was relentless, a plague spreading through the Demon Capital. They wouldn't stop until I was dead. I was born from their darkness, but I refused to be another one of their victims.</p> <p>With my mates and the Supernatural Council at our side, we weren't just surviving anymore—we were hunting. Dark Veil's twisted cult would be torn apart, piece by piece, until nothing remained. We held a secret weapon their leader would never see coming—Nebula—the last remnant of her familiar, who held the key to unraveling her magic.</p> <p>Victory was the only option. To reach it, I had to break free from this curse and embrace my destiny before Dark Veil took over not just the Demon Capital but demonkind altogether.</p>"; 
